cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, and please also cite the
  original M3D paper listed under references.
title: "m3d-LaMed-apple-mps: M3D-LaMed-Phi-3-4B on Apple Silicon (PyTorch MPS)"
abstract: >-
  Inference port of the M3D-LaMed-Phi-3-4B 3D medical vision-language model (3D ViT, Phi-3-mini,
  SegVol) to Apple Silicon with PyTorch MPS. It loads the original checkpoint unchanged, runs
  image-to-text and segmentation entirely on the GPU without CUDA or CPU fallback, and is verified
  token for token against the official implementation.
